<title>USA: Brookdale Living to buy Florida property.</title>
<headline>Brookdale Living to buy Florida property.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brookdale Living Communities Inc, an operator and manager of senior and assisted living services to the elderly, said Thursday it agreed to purchase The Classic, a West Palm Beach, Fla. 300-unit senior and assisted living community.</p>
<p>According to terms, the property will be purchased for $28 million including the assumption of about $22 million of debt.</p>
<p>Brookdale provides senior and assisted living services to the elderly with 10 facilities in six states.</p>
<p>		     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
